    "body": "#codex-reply\nFixed in 0748b4b95b1d68b2a32d84869adb905669d61c44\n\nOutput initialization, `onOutputsReady()`, and the main loop now wait for successful compatibility verification. Handshake completion is bound to its originating manager run, so failed, stopped, or stale handshakes cannot start application work. The receive wait also checks queued responses before sleeping, preventing a fast valid response from being lost.\n"
